follows:\nSection 1. E sta b lish m e n t (a) There is established the Presidential Board of  \nAdvisors on Private Sector Initiatives. The Board shall be composed of not  \nmore than 30 members, to be appointed or designated by the President.\n(b) The President shall designate a Chairman and Vice Chairman from among  \nthe members of the Board. The Deputy Assistant to the President and Director  \nof Private Sector Initiatives shall serve as Secretary to the Board.\nSe","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_12528.txt","sha256":"97eac0182b92513ae12d62de886d4f48ae607e5c792bad19a27a23e6fec58044","source":{"line":1844,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"3f33e3be5fb94962e490947cb3496b73cff708e49f9ee36acd25f9072723e226"}}]}
